{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id521837334"}, "name":{"label":"HARAMBE Mambe"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-10-06T20:08:14-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.6.15.1"}, "id":{"label":"14636669820"}, "title":{"label":"Nice game, UI Doesn’t Fit"}, "content":{"label":"The game is a nice farming sim with RPG elements. It’s fairly playable on iPhone, but the UI elements get cut off around the corners and the camera cutout. This means the inventory bar is hard to fully access, and the energy meter is cut off on the bottom. It’s possible to tweak the UI size and placement a bit, which helps, but it’s not a perfect solution. They should readjust the placement of the UI elements and have a default setting in the menu. If they fixed the UI options then this game would be great.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1406710800&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
