{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id132596426"}, "name":{"label":"Erinalope"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-09-20T18:26:47-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.6.15.1"}, "id":{"label":"14574479036"}, "title":{"label":"Good game,  bad app"}, "content":{"label":"I’ve played this on switch and mobile and mobile is the worst if you want to play with a controller. I slap a controller on my phone, and with a single stroke of the X button you DELETE ITEMS AND TOOLS FROM INVENTORY. No way to fix this, on android it’s at least possible to mod. This puts iOS as the worst version. In the stroke of a button your expensive tool is gone. IDK how this has gone so long without being fixed. Makes it kinda unplayable. \nAlso it’s not made for curved corners and the island/notch so toolbars is weird. Cutting off the top of the toolbar and middle. It feels like they’ve completely abandoned the app, it’s been a long time sense an update.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1406710800&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
