{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id1455350290"}, "name":{"label":"??cangry"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-09-16T20:53:47-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.6.15.1"}, "id":{"label":"14558992330"}, "title":{"label":"Lost game data—unable to fix it and don't know how."}, "content":{"label":"I was playing on Spring 16, Year 4, when a small pop-up suddenly appeared asking whether to load the local or cloud save. Thinking I had saved to the cloud, I selected that option—only for the game to load a save from Winter 22, Year 3. Now I’ve lost hours of gameplay, along with all my hard work and achievements; I don't know what to do.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1406710800&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id998909275"}, "name":{"label":"Airi Min"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-09-16T16:56:32-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.6.15.1"}, "id":{"label":"14558414127"}, "title":{"label":"Fantastic but hard on mobile"}, "content":{"label":"I’ve had this game for six years now and it’s fantastic! It’s entertaining, there’s lots of available items to decorate, and I always end up finding new secrets to explore! The only thing is, the controls are really difficult on mobile. Clicking on a dehydrator can send you to a tile halfway across the farm. Clicking on a rock to break it can mean you no longer have a sword in your hand when an enemy flies at you, meaning you have to run and try to click on your sword at the same time. Decorating can be really hard because clicking on an item won’t always remove or flip it, even if you zoom in. These are only minor things though and are not enough to make me want to not play, even if frustrating! I plan on buying it on PC soon to enjoy the expanded versions! Great game!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1406710800&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
