{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id1237108358"}, "name":{"label":"Sophie_Sticated123"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-09-14T08:12:11-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.6.15.1"}, "id":{"label":"14549274169"}, "title":{"label":"Great game, but the screen fitting for phone is bad"}, "content":{"label":"I really enjoy this game and thought to get it on IOS instead of pc. Only issue is that the screen doesn’t fit well to a phone so it leaves things cut off, like the data box or the energy bar. Even when using the in game scaling options, things are still cut off no matter what because of the curve of the iPhone screen. If this was fixed it would be great! but so far it’s annoying to play with things cut off and not fitting nicely on my screen.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1406710800&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"2"}}, 
